     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Instructions",
     "texto": [
      "To give instructions, the imperative is used: **Κόψε** («cut»), **βάλε** («put»), **ανακάτεψε** («mix»).",
      "**Πρώτα** introduces the first step and **στο τέλος** the last one. **Σε κομμάτια** means in pieces. **Μέχρι να…** means «until…»; here it is enough to learn the expression as a unit."
     ],
